B.afn=s(["The account menu now lets each member choose a cat savings bank, cat food can, bar, donut, balance scale, pie, or hidden cash-flow chart.","Tap a visible chart to see the top three income and expense entries for the selected month, half-year, or year.","The worCat Logo startup screen now stays visible for at least one second, and remains longer when the app still needs to load safely."],t.s)
